":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, I noticed some issues:\r\n\r\n- `stretch_factor` only applies when `stretch` is enabled on SubViewportContainer. However, the property is not hidden in the inspector when `stretch` is disabled.\r\n  - Either we should make `stretch_factor` effective even if `stretch` is disabled, or we should hide `stretch_factor` in the inspector if `stretch` is disabled.\r\n  - `stretch_shrink` should be hidden in the inspector since it's now deprecated (setting it will change `stretch_factor`). This is generally how we proceed with deprecated properties that are \"mapped\" to a non-deprecated property.\r\n  - When resizing the window at runtime in a project that uses the `canvas_items` stretch mode, the SubViewport's size isn't updated automatically, so it will look blurry when resizing to a higher resolution (or grainy when resizing to a lower resolution).\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [3d_in_2d_stretch_factor.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18646888/3d_in_2d_stretch_factor.zip)","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102328#pullrequestreview-2590754889","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102328","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102328#pullrequestreview-2590754889"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102328"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-03T18:56:46Z","commit_id":"13dda819133b1033af6db3d321ae540ae8cd57d2"},{"id":3224382862,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7AMC2O","user":{"login":"MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?u=89d4350f70d480d0457417ef122a7aaa1bb633f7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred","html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu